# Copy to .env and fill in what you need. Every value is optional — the
# extraction and chunking examples run with this file absent entirely.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Database (examples 16-38)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Start it with:  docker compose up -d && python scripts/init_db.py
#
# Port 5433 rather than 5432, so it does not collide with a Postgres you
# already have running locally.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://rag:rag@localhost:5433/rag
#
# Any Postgres 15+ with pgvector works. If you point this at a hosted one and
# the password contains punctuation, percent-encode it: @ becomes %40, &
# becomes %26, # becomes %23. An unencoded # is the nastiest of the three —
# it starts a URL fragment, so everything after it is silently discarded.
#
# Leave unset and the 11 database-free examples still run; the rest explain
# what they need and exit cleanly.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Embeddings
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# "local"  -> sentence-transformers all-MiniLM-L6-v2, 384-dim, free, offline
# "openai" -> text-embedding-3-small, 1536-dim, costs money, needs the key below
# "hash"   -> stdlib token hashing, 384-dim, no install, poor quality
# "auto"   -> local if installed, else hash
EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=local

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generation (the examples marked ★ in the README)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_CHAT_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Behaviour
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RAGKIT_STUB_LLM=1 makes every model call return canned filler. It exists so
# the LLM code paths can be exercised in CI without a key — the mechanics are
# real, the generated text is meaningless, and every run says so loudly.
# RAGKIT_STUB_LLM=0
